      "user_input": null,
      "confidence": "Medium",
      "cwe_id": [915],
      "note": "False positive: InvitesController#create calls `authorize @invited_user` immediately after this mass assignment, before save. UserPolicy#create? checks `invitable_roles.include?(record.role.to_sym)` against the *submitted* role — an interviewer can only invite `candidate`, an admin only `interviewer`/`candidate` — so a request for `role: \"admin\"` (or any role the current user isn't allowed to grant) is rejected by Pundit before the record is ever saved. Covered by spec/requests/invites_spec.rb ('does not let an interviewer escalate an invite to admin', 'does not let an interviewer invite another interviewer')."
    }
  ],
